        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Health-related anxiety"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Longstanding health anxiety is not formally diagnosed. Repeated worries about serious illness, including cancer, and extensive online searching; reassurance is responsive but short-lived. Anxious affect and catastrophising style noted; redirectable with intact insight. No suicidal ideation volunteered."
      }
    },
    {
