          "text": "Cancer concern and assessment"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient asked about cancer markers and a scan. Clinician explained tumour markers were not indicated in this context due to low pretest probability and risk of false positives; malignancy considered low likelihood currently."
      }
    },
